  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1dc66e9658df9284f81f0664a7ee2889, type: 3}
  m_Name: ChimeEchoAstralHouseCollectible
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CollectableEntries
  entryTitle: A Note from Chime
  description: 
  neutralDescription: "I\u2019m glad that Echo\u2019s here, but something feels\u2026different.
    Was Echo always this aloof? Were they always more interested in sleeping than
    anything else, even a whole new world outside? Are they shutting down from the
    confusion. Echo, I need you to care\u2026"
  negativeDescription: "\u2026have I made a mistake? I remember Echo being caring,
    determined and benevolent no matter what\u2019s thrown at them. That\u2019s not
    what I got from our recent meeting. They seemed almost upset at my presence.
    Hopefully they\u2019re just tired and maybe a bit startled, accustoming to the
    \u201Cnew\u201D environment."
  positiveDescription: "Echo\u2019s here! They\u2019re really here!! I feel bad for
    startling them when they woke up, but I couldn\u2019t be happier that they\u2019ve
    come. They\u2019re probably so confused. I was successful in bringing them here,
    but at the cost of some of their memories. I hope to be able to explain everything
    in due time\u2026"
